Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},</span></span>
<p>Under the United States Department of Transport Rule on Refunds and Other Consumer protections, passengers traveling on flights to, from, or within the United States are entitled to a refund for ancillary fees (if not included in the original fare) if your flight has been significantly delayed. &nbsp; &nbsp;<br />
We have processed a refund of the amount $[Case. Recovery_Value] to your credit card / bank account.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
On behalf of the team at Qantas, we sincerely apologise for the inconvenience experienced.</p>

<p>Kind regards,<br />
&nbsp;</p>
